@startuml sequence-diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title Sequence Diagram - Flux Principal

actor User as U
participant Dashboard as D
participant API as API
database MongoDB as DB
queue Kafka as K
participant KStream as KS

== Interface Utilisateur ==
U -> D : Ouvrir dashboard
D -> API : GET /stats/critiques
API -> DB : Query sinistres_critiques
DB --> API : Return results
API --> D : Return JSON
D --> U : Display table

== Traitement Background ==
note over K,KS : Background processing
K -> KS : Consume sinistre
KS -> KS : Filter > 10k
KS -> K : Publish critique
K -> DB : Sink to MongoDB

@enduml
